{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 170895, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 115318, "uid": 154257, "type": 4, "title": "RB、RACE角色总表", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1667400136, "updated_at": 1685848775, "updated_uid": 154257, "comment_at": 1667667250, "last_at": 1685848775, "comment_count": 1, "status": 1, "summary": "本表是5人巨大BOSS本的组队基础。5人巨大BOSS本因位置有限，要求上场角色一专多能，因此组队时有捷径可循。标准架构是1刀4辅助，辅助应当覆盖加速、增伤、生存三类技能。这三类技能均不可能全部上场，应", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2510/h_3627/1164/154257/2023/4/27/598941.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2378/h_2940/1164/154257/2023/5/4/220409.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 17, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 10479, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 6, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 170895, "content": "<div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">本表是5人巨大BOSS本的组队基础。</span></span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">5人巨大BOSS本因位置有限，要求上场角色一专多能，因此组队时有捷径可循。</span><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">标准架构是1刀4辅助，辅助应当覆盖加速、增伤、生存三类技能。这三类技能均不可能全部上场，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">应在尽量不重复的前提下取最强组合。最强组合通常只有一个，并且策划<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">设计时</span>自然会确保避开技能冲突，因此并不<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">真正</span>需要手动排列大量组合，只要盯住几个关键技能即可。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">加速技能的基础是充能量up和充能速度up，也就是①区的两列角色都要，简单且稳定。</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">如果用时间歪曲代替其一也并非绝对不可行，但不建议作为常规思路采用。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">增伤技能情况相对复杂，种类繁多，可ban可增，在机制层面没有绝对不可缺少的基础技能，只要整体面板够高即可。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">②区已经按从左至右峰值递减排序，总体来说靠左和技能多的角色地位更高。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">至于生存技能，①+②区</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">通常</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">自然会有安排，无需另选角色，并且还可通过附魔、人偶等方式强化，够用即可。</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">RB限定技能在RACE中有效，RACE限定技能在RB中无效。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">所有数据为U练度。</span><br></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">RB</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"2510\" data-height=\"3627\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2510/h_3627/1164/154257/2023/4/27/598941.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2510/h_3627/1164/154257/2023/4/27/598941.jpg\"></div><br></div><br></div></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                       